sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Backend as Adapter 聚合器
    participant Parser as 前端严格解析
    participant Store as SessionStore
    participant Queue as 播放释放队列
    participant Timeline as PlaybackTimeline
    participant UI as 前端状态

    rect rgb(253, 239, 235)
        Note over Backend,UI: motion 结构合法但领域校验失败
        Backend->>Parser: output.segment(text + audio + invalid motion)
        Parser->>Parser: 先归一化全部 slots
        Parser--xStore: 不提交
        Parser--xQueue: 不排队文本或音频
        Parser->>UI: fatal protocol error / close connection
    end

    rect rgb(247, 241, 230)
        Note over Backend,UI: 重复 turn_id + message_id
        Backend->>Parser: duplicate output.segment
        Parser->>Store: commitOutputSegment
        Store--xParser: Duplicate output segment
        Note over Store,Queue: 旧段保持不变，第二段零副作用
        Parser->>UI: fatal protocol error
    end

    rect rgb(239, 246, 249)
        Note over Backend,UI: synth_finished 前发现内部不完整段
        Backend->>Store: control.synth_finished
        Store->>Store: assertOutputSegmentsResolved
        Store--xBackend: incomplete atomic segment
        Note over Store: 不把 idle audio/motion 自动标记 absent
        Store->>UI: protocol consistency error
    end

    rect rgb(235, 244, 232)
        Note over Backend,UI: 合法的 absent 与 failed
        Backend->>Parser: output.segment(audio=absent)
        Parser->>Store: atomic commit
        Store->>Timeline: motion-only / text-only 可执行
        Backend->>Parser: output.segment(audio=failed)
        Parser->>Store: atomic commit
        Store->>Timeline: 文本可释放，动作标记失败
        Note over Store,Timeline: failed 不转换为 absent
    end

    rect rgb(245, 235, 241)
        Note over Backend,UI: output queue 已关闭
        Backend->>Parser: late output.segment
        Parser->>Store: commitOutputSegment
        Store--xParser: reject after synth_finished
        Note over Parser,UI: 不存在 late slot 补播
    end
